<title>SPAIN: Madrid forex market shut all day on New Year's Eve.</title>
<headline>Madrid forex market shut all day on New Year's Eve.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid bourse is to open for a full session on New Year's Eve, a spokesman for the stock market said on Monday.</p>
<p>However the bond market will end trade at 1200 GMT on Tuesday, a spokesman for futures market MEFF said.</p>
<p>The local forex market meanwhile will stop trade for the whole day, a Bank of Spain spokesman said.</p>
<p>All three markets are closed on New Year's Day.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
